title: The Senate
subtitle: A majority of one can amend, delay and expose. It cannot govern from the upper chamber.
new-page: true
call: poland_senate.refresh

= The Senate ledger

The opposition pact controls **[+ senate_opposition_seats +] of 100 seats**, but
only **[+ senate_working_votes +] votes** can presently be relied upon. Its
cohesion is **[+ senate_cohesion +]/100**. The two
<span class="party party-lewica"><b>Lewica</b></span> senators hold
**[+ senate_left_leverage +]/100 leverage** inside the pact.

An ordinary statute can be accepted, amended or rejected. The Sejm may overturn
the Senate's position with the constitutionally required majority. A budget
statute is different: the Senate has a shorter timetable and may propose
amendments, but it cannot reject the budget outright.

- @ordinary_bill: Open the ordinary-bill docket
- @budget_bill: Open the pending budget docket
- @return_hub: Return to the leadership table

@refresh
call: poland_normalize
on-arrival: {!
const senateDefaults = {
    senate_total: 100,
    senate_pis_seats: 48,
    senate_ko_seats: 43,
    senate_psl_seats: 3,
    senate_left_seats: 2,
    senate_independent_seats: 4,
    senate_cohesion: 52,
    senate_left_leverage: 18,
    senate_amendment_credit: 0
};
for (const key of Object.keys(senateDefaults)) {
    if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q[key]))) {
        Q[key] = senateDefaults[key];
    }
}
if (!Q.senate_marshal) Q.senate_marshal = "Tomasz Grodzki";
if (!Q.senate_last_vote) Q.senate_last_vote = "No common vote yet";
if (!Q.senate_control) Q.senate_control = "Fragile opposition pact";
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.ko_relation))) Q.ko_relation = 40;
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.psl_relation))) Q.psl_relation = 25;

Q.senate_opposition_seats =
    Q.senate_ko_seats + Q.senate_psl_seats +
    Q.senate_left_seats + Q.senate_independent_seats;
Q.senate_majority_threshold = Math.floor(Q.senate_total / 2) + 1;

let unreliableVotes = 0;
if (Q.senate_cohesion < 65) unreliableVotes += 1;
if (Q.senate_cohesion < 45) unreliableVotes += 1;
if (Q.senate_cohesion < 30) unreliableVotes += 1;
if (Q.ko_relation < 35) unreliableVotes += 1;
if (Q.psl_relation < 20) unreliableVotes += 1;

let recoveredVote = 0;
if (unreliableVotes > 0 && Q.senate_left_leverage >= 35) {
    recoveredVote = 1;
}
Q.senate_working_votes = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.min(
        Q.senate_opposition_seats,
        Q.senate_opposition_seats - unreliableVotes + recoveredVote
    )
);
Q.senate_non_left_opposition =
    Q.senate_opposition_seats - Q.senate_left_seats;
Q.senate_left_is_pivotal =
    Q.senate_non_left_opposition < Q.senate_majority_threshold &&
    Q.senate_working_votes >= Q.senate_majority_threshold ? 1 : 0;

if (Q.senate_working_votes >= Q.senate_majority_threshold) {
    Q.senate_control = "Working opposition majority";
} else if (Q.senate_working_votes == Q.senate_majority_threshold - 1) {
    Q.senate_control = "Deadlocked chamber";
} else {
    Q.senate_control = "PiS procedural edge";
}
!}

@ordinary_bill
title: An ordinary bill reaches the Senate
subtitle: Thirty-day review; amend, reject or accept before the Sejm answers.
new-page: true
call: poland_senate.refresh
on-arrival: {!
if (!Q.senate_pending_bill || Q.senate_pending_bill_type != "ordinary") {
    Q.senate_pending_bill = "The government's current ordinary statute";
}
if (!Q.senate_bill_topic) {
    Q.senate_bill_topic =
        Q.year >= 2020
            ? "emergency administration and parliamentary oversight"
            : "institutional procedure and local-government safeguards";
}
Q.senate_pending_bill_type = "ordinary";
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.senate_docket_ready))) {
    Q.senate_docket_ready = 1;
}
!}

= Ordinary bill — [+ senate_pending_bill +]

The docket concerns **[+ senate_bill_topic +]**. Marshal
**[+ senate_marshal +]** can give the opposition time to build one position, but
procedure cannot manufacture a majority. The pact currently has
**[+ senate_working_votes +] reliable votes**; **[+ senate_majority_threshold +]**
are required.

[? if senate_left_is_pivotal: Without the two Left senators, the opposition
cannot assemble a majority. That creates leverage, not ownership of the
chamber. ?]

[? if not senate_docket_ready: The full negotiating team is still committed to
an earlier docket. A minority report remains available, so this card can always
be resolved safely. ?]

- @ordinary_left_amendment
- @ordinary_common_amendment
- @ordinary_rejection
- @ordinary_fallback

@ordinary_left_amendment
title: Make a Left safeguard the price of the opposition majority
subtitle: Spend 8 Senate leverage. A visible amendment, and a visible use of two pivotal votes.
choose-if: senate_docket_ready = 1 and senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold and senate_left_leverage >= 8
unavailable-subtitle: Requires a ready docket, a working majority and at least 8 Senate leverage.
on-arrival: senate_left_leverage -= 8; senate_amendment_credit += 2; senate_cohesion -= 2; labor_credibility += 2; progressive_credibility += 2; public_trust += 1; senate_last_vote = "The opposition adopted a Left-authored safeguard"; news_headline = "Two Left senators put their language into the bill"; senate_pending_bill_type = "none"

The opposition adopts the safeguard because it needs every vote. PiS can still
remove it in the Sejm, but must now vote against named protections rather than
against an abstract Senate objection.

- #poland_card_finish

@ordinary_common_amendment
title: Broker one common opposition amendment
subtitle: Build cohesion and leverage by making the upper chamber look serious.
choose-if: senate_docket_ready = 1 and senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The negotiating team is unavailable, or the pact cannot currently reach 51.
on-arrival: senate_cohesion += 5; senate_left_leverage += 4; senate_amendment_credit += 1; ko_relation += 2; psl_relation += 2; constitutional_restraint += 2; public_trust += 1; senate_last_vote = "A common opposition amendment passed"; news_headline = "The Senate majority survives an ordinary bill"; senate_pending_bill_type = "none"

KO supplies most votes, PSL narrows the language, independents insist on a clean
record and the Left supplies a reason to amend rather than merely delay. The
Sejm receives one defensible text.

- #poland_card_finish

@ordinary_rejection
title: Reject the bill and force the Sejm to override
subtitle: A sharp constitutional signal. The majority must be unusually cohesive.
choose-if: senate_docket_ready = 1 and senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold and senate_cohesion >= 55
unavailable-subtitle: Requires a ready 51-vote bloc and at least 55 Senate cohesion.
on-arrival: senate_cohesion -= 6; senate_left_leverage += 3; constitutional_restraint += 3; pis_relation -= 5; public_trust += 1; senate_last_vote = "The Senate rejected an ordinary statute"; news_headline = "The Senate forces PiS to vote twice"; senate_pending_bill_type = "none"

The rejection does not veto the statute. It forces the governing majority to
assemble again in public and accept sole ownership of the text. If that majority
holds, the bill returns unchanged.

- #poland_card_finish

@ordinary_fallback
title: Publish a minority note and let the Sejm own the statute
subtitle: No cost and no majority required. The safe procedural fallback.
on-arrival: senate_left_leverage += 1; senate_last_vote = "The Left filed a minority note on an ordinary statute"; news_headline = "The Senate docket closes without a common majority"; senate_pending_bill_type = "none"

The Left records objections, proposed language and the final roll call. Nothing
is invented, no unavailable resource is spent and the monthly action resolves
normally even when the opposition pact is deadlocked.

- #poland_card_finish

@budget_bill
title: A budget bill reaches the Senate
subtitle: Twenty-day review; amendments are possible, outright rejection is not.
new-page: true
call: poland_senate.refresh
on-arrival: {!
if (!Number.isFinite(Number(Q.senate_budget_year)) ||
    Number(Q.senate_budget_year) === 0) {
    if (Q.budget_2020_done && !Q.senate_budget_2020_done) {
        Q.senate_budget_year = 2020;
    } else if (Q.budget_2019_done && !Q.senate_budget_2019_done) {
        Q.senate_budget_year = 2019;
    } else {
        Q.senate_budget_year = 0;
    }
}
Q.senate_pending_bill_type = "budget";
!}
go-to: budget_2019 if senate_budget_year = 2019; budget_2020 if senate_budget_year = 2020; budget_unscheduled

@budget_unscheduled
title: No budget stage is pending
new-page: true

The Senate clerk finds no unresolved budget bill. An ordinary docket can still
be worked, but no fiscal vote should be fabricated from an old or incomplete
save.

- @return_hub: Return to the leadership table

@budget_2019
title: The 2020 budget reaches the Senate
subtitle: The new opposition majority gets its first fiscal test.
new-page: true
call: poland_senate.refresh
on-arrival: senate_budget_year = 2019; senate_pending_bill_type = "budget"; senate_pending_bill = "The 2020 state budget"

= Senate stage — the first budget

The Sejm has completed its vote. The Senate has twenty days to propose
amendments to the **2020 state budget**. It cannot reject the budget. Whatever
passes here returns to the PiS majority in the Sejm.

The opposition pact has **[+ senate_working_votes +] reliable votes**. The Left's
internal position received **[+ budget_2019_backing +]% backing** with
**[+ budget_2019_vetoes +] internal vetoes**.

- @budget_2019_common
- @budget_2019_broker
- @budget_2019_record

@budget_2019_common
title: Put the ratified Left shadow budget into the common amendment slate
subtitle: Spend 10 Senate leverage. The Sejm can reject it, but not pretend no alternative was costed.
view-if: budget_2019_ratified = 1
choose-if: senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold and senate_left_leverage >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: Requires 51 reliable votes and 10 Senate leverage.
on-arrival: senate_left_leverage -= 10; senate_cohesion += 4; senate_amendment_credit += 3; public_trust += 2; labor_credibility += 2; ko_relation += 2; senate_budget_2019_done = 1; senate_budget_2019_result = "Common costed amendments passed"; senate_last_vote = "The Senate amended the 2020 budget on a common Left-backed slate"; news_headline = "The first opposition Senate majority writes a social budget amendment"
go-to: budget_2019_complete

The package passes the Senate as amendments on hospitals, wages, housing and
labour inspection. PiS retains the votes to remove them in the Sejm, but the
opposition has produced one set of numbers and one roll call.

@budget_2019_broker
title: Broker one clinic-and-labour-inspection amendment
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Can recover a single missing Senate vote.
choose-if: resources >= 1 and senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold - 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires one resource and at least 50 reliable senators.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; senate_working_votes = 51 if senate_working_votes < 51; senate_left_leverage += 5; senate_cohesion += 2; senate_amendment_credit += 1; psl_relation += 3; ko_relation += 1; public_trust += 1; senate_budget_2019_done = 1; senate_budget_2019_result = "One narrow social amendment passed"; senate_last_vote = "The Senate adopted a narrow clinic-and-inspection amendment"; news_headline = "The Left brokers the Senate's narrowest budget majority"
go-to: budget_2019_complete

One independent senator is brought back to the table by language narrow enough
for PSL and material enough for the Left. It is a smaller achievement than a
shadow budget and a real test of whether the majority can count to fifty-one.

@budget_2019_record
title: File the separate positions and permit no fictitious common amendment
subtitle: Always available. The Senate cannot reject the budget.
on-arrival: senate_cohesion -= 2; senate_left_leverage -= 1 if senate_left_leverage > 0; senate_budget_2019_done = 1; senate_budget_2019_result = "No common Senate amendment"; senate_last_vote = "The 2020 budget left the Senate without a common opposition amendment"; news_headline = "The new Senate majority fails its first fiscal rehearsal"
go-to: budget_2019_complete

The budget returns to the Sejm without a common opposition amendment. The
record remains accurate: internal disagreement was not converted into a power
the Senate does not possess.

@budget_2019_complete
on-arrival: senate_pending_bill_type = "none"; senate_pending_bill = "No bill pending"; senate_budget_year = 0
go-to: poland_hub

@budget_2020
title: The 2021 pandemic budget reaches the Senate
subtitle: Health, local government and the Women's Strike meet a majority of one.
new-page: true
call: poland_senate.refresh
on-arrival: senate_budget_year = 2020; senate_pending_bill_type = "budget"; senate_pending_bill = "The 2021 pandemic budget"

= Senate stage — the pandemic budget

The Senate may amend the **2021 pandemic budget**, but it may not reject it.
Hospitals, household income, local finance and equality measures now compete
inside a twenty-day timetable.

Reliable opposition votes: **[+ senate_working_votes +]**. Senate cohesion:
**[+ senate_cohesion +]/100**. Left leverage: **[+ senate_left_leverage +]/100**.

- @budget_2020_social
- @budget_2020_local
- @budget_2020_equality
- @budget_2020_selective
- @budget_2020_record

@budget_2020_social
title: Carry the social-shield package into Senate amendments
subtitle: Spend 10 Senate leverage on hospitals, sick pay, wages and housing.
view-if: budget_package_code = 1
choose-if: senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold and senate_left_leverage >= 10
unavailable-subtitle: Requires 51 reliable votes and 10 Senate leverage.
on-arrival: senate_left_leverage -= 10; senate_cohesion += 3; senate_amendment_credit += 3; household_security += 2; health_capacity += 2; labor_credibility += 2; public_trust += 2; senate_budget_2020_done = 1; senate_budget_2020_result = "Social-shield amendments passed"; senate_last_vote = "The Senate amended the pandemic budget with the social shield"; news_headline = "The Senate gives the pandemic budget a social opposition"
go-to: budget_2020_complete

The Senate majority holds around a package that can be defended in hospitals,
workplaces and rented homes. The Sejm may strip it out; the government must do
so line by line.

@budget_2020_local
title: Build the Senate slate around local survival
subtitle: PSL and independents can hold this majority together.
view-if: budget_package_code = 2
choose-if: senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: The opposition pact cannot presently assemble 51 votes.
on-arrival: senate_cohesion += 6; senate_left_leverage += 4; senate_amendment_credit += 2; psl_relation += 4; local_network += 2; health_capacity += 1; public_trust += 1; senate_budget_2020_done = 1; senate_budget_2020_result = "Local-survival amendments passed"; senate_last_vote = "The Senate amended the pandemic budget around local survival"; news_headline = "Counties and hospitals hold the Senate majority together"
go-to: budget_2020_complete

County hospitals, public transport and local-government liquidity create the
widest upper-chamber agreement. The Left gains less programme ownership and
more evidence that a material rural bargain can work.

@budget_2020_equality
title: Demand an equality-and-care amendment slate
subtitle: PSL must be persuaded, or 30 Senate leverage must substitute for goodwill.
view-if: budget_package_code = 3
choose-if: senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold and ((psl_relation >= 25 and psl_accept_rights >= 35) or senate_left_leverage >= 30)
unavailable-subtitle: Requires 51 votes plus either a receptive PSL rights caucus or 30 Senate leverage.
on-arrival: senate_left_leverage -= 12 if senate_left_leverage >= 30 and psl_relation < 25; senate_cohesion -= 4; senate_amendment_credit += 3; progressive_credibility += 3; feminist_trust += 3; psl_relation -= 3; public_trust += 1; senate_budget_2020_done = 1; senate_budget_2020_result = "Equality-and-care amendments passed"; senate_last_vote = "The Senate adopted equality-and-care pandemic amendments"; news_headline = "The Women's Strike reaches the Senate budget"
go-to: budget_2020_complete

Care funding and practical reproductive access survive a vote that the
opposition pact would rather avoid. The victory consumes stored leverage and
makes the next PSL threat more credible.

@budget_2020_selective
title: Consolidate the useful provisions into one technical amendment
subtitle: A modest Senate intervention cannot turn a selective PiS deal into a common Left budget.
view-if: budget_package_code = 4
choose-if: senate_working_votes >= senate_majority_threshold
unavailable-subtitle: Even the technical amendment requires 51 reliable votes.
on-arrival: senate_cohesion += 1; senate_left_leverage += 2; senate_amendment_credit += 1; government_delivery += 1; budget_breaches += 1; public_trust -= 1; senate_budget_2020_done = 1; senate_budget_2020_result = "One technical amendment passed"; senate_last_vote = "The Senate consolidated selected pandemic provisions"; news_headline = "A Senate amendment cannot disguise a fragmented budget line"
go-to: budget_2020_complete

The chamber improves one provision without inventing a fiscal programme that
the Left never ratified. Delivery rises slightly; the recorded breach remains.

@budget_2020_record
title: Return the budget without a common Senate amendment
subtitle: Always available. A budget bill cannot be rejected here.
on-arrival: senate_cohesion -= 3; senate_left_leverage -= 2 if senate_left_leverage >= 2; public_trust -= 1; senate_budget_2020_done = 1; senate_budget_2020_result = "No common Senate amendment"; senate_last_vote = "The pandemic budget left the Senate without a common amendment"; news_headline = "The Senate majority fractures over the pandemic budget"
go-to: budget_2020_complete

Separate speeches are entered into the record. The budget proceeds on its
constitutional timetable, and the opposition majority loses some of the value
created by winning the chamber.

@budget_2020_complete
on-arrival: senate_pending_bill_type = "none"; senate_pending_bill = "No bill pending"; senate_budget_year = 0
go-to: poland_events.budget_consequence

@return_hub
go-to: poland_hub
